<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of soccer matches played in the German first division on Saturday:</p>
<p>Borussia Dortmund 2 (Tretschok 50th, Kirovski 79th) Duisburg 0. Halftime 0-0. Attendance 48,800</p>
<p>Hamburg 2 (Breitenreiter 6th, Baeron 37th) Arminia Bielefeld 2 (Meissner 57th, Breitkreutz 61st-penalty). 2-0. 31,180</p>
<p>Werder Bremen 3 (Herzog 34th, Bode-59th, 90th) Schalke 0. 1-0. 34,719</p>
<p>Karlsruhe 1 (Tarnat 4th) Bayer Leverkusen 1 (Feldhoff 74th). 1-0. 25,000</p>
<p>Hansa Rostock 2 (Akpoborie 74th, Baumgart 90th) VfB Stuttgart 2 (Bobic 25th, Balakov 38th). 0-2. 22,000</p>
<p>Cologne 2 (Hauptmann 59th, Polster 77th-penalty), Bayern Munich 4 (Klinsmann-35th, 68th, Scholl 56th-penalty, Witeczek 90th). 0-1. 52,000</p>
